tools/dev-server/build/

# Rendered audio, which `musictool render` writes into a project bundle.
#
# Anchored to the fixtures rather than written as a bare `render/`. That pattern
# matches a directory of that name at *any* depth, so it also swallowed
# `packages/engine/src/render/` — source, not output. Files already tracked there
# stayed tracked, because ignoring does not affect what git already knows, so the
# only casualty was each *new* source file added to that directory: skipped
# silently by `git add -A`, present locally, absent from CI. Keep this anchored.
fixtures/**/render/
